description=Lite cleanup with WebUI RSS current/peak and Telegram traffic counters (reset on daemon restart), throttled diagnostics, and temporary cooldown for HTTP 5xx WSS frontends; TG Open v2.1.18 baseline with DC1 fix, watchdog recovery, adaptive direct/Cloudflare route selection, WebSocket keepalive and Obfuscated2 CTR offset rollback, WSS stale-tunnel detection, early-EOF route cooldown, persistent service supervisor, boot-race recovery and WebUI foreground rule reassertion and abridged Quick ACK framing fix and Android cgroup freezer protection and disabled client-originated WSS Ping after interval-correlated remote EOF; best-effort target-app cgroup freezer protection; persistent last-known-good WSS route cache across daemon restarts; removed the v2.1.42 Android Doze/app-standby policy after reported regressions; cached WSS route first before direct ingress; DC1 hardcoded route now respects early-EOF cooldown; repeated low-volume early EOF threshold reduced to two; legacy cached route candidates retained but background route-pool/pulse probes disabled; supervisor checks every 60 seconds; Android ARM64; WSS-only.
webuiIcon=webroot/module_icon.png
